user default off
user zone on >zone-dev-password ~dir:* ~app:* ~events ~kicks ~bus:idem:* ~world:state &zone:*:requests &api:*:replies +@all -@admin -@dangerous
user api on >api-dev-password ~dir:* ~events &zone:*:requests &api:*:replies +@connection +@pubsub +@stream +@read (~app:* +set)
user login on >login-dev-password ~kicks %R~world:state +@connection +xadd +get
